example
 set x to 2
 glue pi to 3.14
 
 if x = 0:
   say("x is 0")
 else if x > 0:
   say("x is positive!")
 else:
   say("x is negative!)
 end
 
 repeat 5:
   say("hello")
 end
 
 repeat 5 as i
   say(i)
 end
 
 func add a b:
  return a + b
 end
 
 say(add(2, 3)

githubRepo https://github.com/legospider15/Sampi
 description Sampi is a dynamicly typed language designed with a small set of keywords to be easy to learn.
